<title>INDIA: India Tata Electric Cos 96/97 net down.</title>
<headline>India Tata Electric Cos 96/97 net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31,1997.</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	2,297.7     vs     4,435.5</p>
<p>    Sales	    23,447.2     vs    22,845.0</p>
<p>    Other income    1,768.9     vs     1,814.3</p>
<p>    Expenditure    18,155.7     vs    15,560.8</p>
<p>    Interest	  1,471.2     vs     1,534.6</p>
<p>    Gross profit    5,589.2     vs     7,663.9</p>
<p>    Depreciation    1,546.8     vs     1,492.4</p>
<p>    Tax		 1,744.7     vs     1,636.0</p>
<p>Note: India's Tata Electric Companies (TEC) is a conglomerate of three firms, the Tata Hydro-electric Power Supply Co Ltd, the Andhra Valley Power Supply Co Ltd, and the Tata Power Company Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
